\r\n* -11100: The source Equipment, specified by SourceEquipmentNId, does not belong to the Equipment Flow, identified by EquipmentFlowNId ","FullInfo":"Starting from a Source Equipment, that must be included in an Equipment Flow, the command retrieves all the Equipment, contained in the flow, that can be used as destination for a move operation.\r\nFurthermore, specifying a Material or a Material Group, you can retrieve the list of destination Equipment that handle a specific Material or group of materials.\r\n### Return codes\r\n* -10859: The piece of Equipment, identified by SourceEquipmentNId, does not exist\r\n* -10856: The Equipment Flow, identified by EquipmentFlowNId, does not exist\r\n* -11100: The source Equipment, specified by SourceEquipmentNId, does not belong to the Equipment Flow, identified by EquipmentFlowNId ","InfoMap":{"$id":"2657","FullIdObj":{"$id":"2658","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Starting from a Source Equipment, that must be included in an Equipment Flow, the command retrieves all the Equipment, contained in the flow, that can be used as destination for a move operation.\r\nFurthermore, specifying a Material or a Material Group, you can retrieve the list of destination Equipment that handle a specific Material or group of materials.\r\n### Return codes\r\n* -10859: The piece of Equipment, identified by SourceEquipmentNId, does not exist\r\n* -10856: The Equipment Flow, identified by EquipmentFlowNId, does not exist\r\n* -11100: The source Equipment, specified by SourceEquipmentNId, does not belong to the Equipment Flow, identified by EquipmentFlowNId ","FullInfo":"Starting from a Source Equipment, that must be included in an Equipment Flow, the command retrieves all the Equipment, contained in the flow, that can be used as destination for a move operation.\r\nFurthermore, specifying a Material or a Material Group, you can retrieve the list of destination Equipment that handle a specific Material or group of materials.\r\n### Return codes\r\n* -10859: The piece of Equipment, identified by SourceEquipmentNId, does not exist\r\n* -10856: The Equipment Flow, identified by EquipmentFlowNId, does not exist\r\n* -11100: The source Equipment, specified by SourceEquipmentNId, does not belong to the Equipment Flow, identified by EquipmentFlowNId ","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"2658"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Starting from a Source Equipment, that must be included in an Equipment Flow, the command retrieves all the Equipment, contained in the flow, that can be used as destination for a move operation.\r\nFurthermore, specifying a Material or a Material Group, you can retrieve the list of destination Equipment that handle a specific Material or group of materials.\r\n### Return codes\r\n* -10859: The piece of Equipment, identified by SourceEquipmentNId, does not exist\r\n* -10856: The Equipment Flow, identified by EquipmentFlowNId, does not exist\r\n* -11100: The source Equipment, specified by SourceEquipmentNId, does not belong to the Equipment Flow, identified by EquipmentFlowNId ","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Starting from a Source Equipment, that must be included in an Equipment Flow, the command retrieves all the Equipment, contained in the flow, that can be used as destination for a move operation.\r\nFurthermore, specifying a Material or a Material Group, you can retrieve the list of destination Equipment that handle a specific Material or group of materials.\r\n### Return codes\r\n* -10859: The piece of Equipment, identified by SourceEquipmentNId, does not exist\r\n* -10856: The Equipment Flow, identified by EquipmentFlowNId, does not exist\r\n* -11100: The source Equipment, specified by SourceEquipmentNId, does not belong to the Equipment Flow, identified by EquipmentFlowNId "},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"2659","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keywo